1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,400
One morning, the world got loud.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,400
Whispers. Everywhere.

3
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,900
Then you realized...

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,900
...you could hear what people were thinking.

5
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:33,800
What if you could hear what people really think?

6
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:39,300
On the train, everyone was thinking...

7
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:44,500
...about you. Or so it felt.

8
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:52,100
"They think I'm weird."

9
00:00:53,500 --> 00:01:00,900
At work, you kept your head down.

10
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,400
You rehearsed every word.

11
00:01:18,500 --> 00:01:20,700
You deleted every post.

12
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,200
You wanted to say hi.

13
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,400
You didn't.

14
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:38,700
Because you knew what she'd think.

15
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:47,400
Every day, you made yourself smaller.

16
00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:53,500
Then one day, you finally listened.

17
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,400
Nobody was thinking about you.

18
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:15,900
They were scared of the same thing.

19
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:26,400
Even her.

20
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:38,500
Everyone was fighting a battle you couldn't see.

21
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:47,500
Everyone was too busy worrying about themselves.

22
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:53,400
Nobody is watching you as closely as you think.

23
00:02:54,800 --> 00:03:00,800
So you stopped hiding.

24
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:11,400
You drew in the park. In public.

25
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:18,100
You sang at an open mic.

26
00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:23,500
Badly. And nobody cared.

27
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:28,400
You said hi.

28
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:34,000
She'd been waiting for someone to.

29
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,800
Everyone still has their thoughts.

30
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:47,400
Yours just got quieter.

31
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:54,900
They're not thinking about you.

32
00:03:56,500 --> 00:04:02,100
So live like nobody's listening.

